O, Bože.</i>

712
00:57:43.213 --> 00:57:44.353
<i>Bir, jesi li dobro?</i>

713
00:57:45.193 --> 00:57:46.813
<i>O, Bože.</i>

714
00:57:47.193 --> 00:57:47.893
<i>Tata.</i>

715
00:57:47.993 --> 00:57:51.546
